  1909	// checkoutBlockers are the blockers of the sealed checkout that hold there. Two kinds do not,
  1910	// because they concern evidence that is not part of the sealed subject and that a checkout of
  1911	// the sealed commit cannot hold: the delivery integrity index (derived, not checked out) and the
  1912	// sealed review bundles of the children of a roadmap or milestone. The children are reviewed and
